        <briefdescription>
<para>Create a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_dynamic_library_search_generator" kindref="compound">DynamicLibrarySearchGenerator</ref> that searches for symbols in the library with the given handle. </para>
        </briefdescription>
